.dockerignore
# Never read at run time (v1.8.70): the docs site, the two historical
# tarballs and the CI workflows. CI builds the image from a git checkout, so
# without these lines all three would ship in it — old/ was never in a release
# tarball, and docs/ and .github/ only ever rode along unused.
docs
old
.github
# Development-only quality tooling and its node_modules (v1.9.8): never read
# at run time.
tools
.githooks
# Developer documents (v1.9.8): read by contributors and by Claude, never at
# run time.
dev
# The Windows build's output (v1.9.67-t7): tools/windows/build.js writes
# here, and nothing of it belongs in an image or a payload.
dist
# The Android app's source (dev/design/android-app.md §4.8): built by its own workflow
# (android.yml), never read by the server.
android
